	(property "Description" "The ball seat of ErgoCai.modules trackball/PMW3610, the trackball on the keyboard board itself (cup.js --fix case --style seat --support 2 --ball 20, 3D printed, after htx-studio's One-Handed Keyboard seat): a frame round it standing on the keyboard board, which snaps under the case's top layer by a hook arm at each end (as the pogo modules' cartridges), and a shell that follows the ball; three 2 mm balls set half into the wall carry it, three more in vertical holes in three lugs over the equator hold it down. Its F.CrtYd rectangle is the pogo mount's courtyard, which the case's layers open round (grown by 1.5 and 2.5): the frame fits the same opening. No copper, nothing in the BOM. Origin on the ball's axis, the sensor's optical centre; the model is cup.js --step, with the 20 mm ball and the six small ones, for the lens's reference plane 4.35 mm over a 1.6 mm board."
		(at 0 0 0)
